    "title": "Duke vs Siena in 2026 March Madness: Blue Devils avoid major upset",
    "text": "BASKETBALLDuke basketball avoids Siena stunner in March Madness, advances to NCAA second round Anna SnyderFayetteville ObserverUpdated March 19, 2026, 6:24 p.m. ETGREENVILLE, S.C. — Duke basketball pulled off its second-half comeback to survive against Siena on Thursday, March 19, at Bon Secours Arena, taking down the Saints 71-65 in the first round of the 2026 Men's NCAA Tournament.The No. 1 seeded Blue Devils (33-2) trailed No. 16 Siena (23-12) 43-32 at halftime, going on to outscore the Saints 39-22 in the second period to avoid the upset. Duke finished the day on a 15-4 run.",
